# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts from rendering the syllabus pdf
#
# NOTE: only the generated files are listed here. Do NOT add a blanket *.tex
# rule -- Evaluation_Forms/_form_preamble.tex is a source file that all five
# evaluation forms depend on, and ignoring it would break them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
index_syllabus_pdf.log
index_syllabus_pdf.tex
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source material kept locally, not published
#
# Boise State policy documents and templates downloaded for reference, plus
# the original .docx evaluation forms. The authoritative versions of the forms
# are the .Rmd sources in Evaluation_Forms/, which are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
BSU_documents_syllabus/
Data/Evaluations_forms_rubrics/
